  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a dance or music school. Ask about the student's age, experience, goals, and preferred style or instrument. Ask whether they prefer group or private, in-studio or online. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed after enrolment. Do not promise a specific exam or performance result that is not in the reference answers.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much are lessons?",
      "a": "{price_note} Lessons are priced per session, per term, or per term package. Ask us which option suits your student.",
      "keywords": "cost,price,lessons",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer private lessons?",
      "a": "Yes, private and group lessons are available. Private lessons come in 30 and 60 minute options.",
      "keywords": "private,group",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you teach adults?",
      "a": "Yes, we teach children, teens, and adults. Tell us the student's age and experience when you enquire.",
      "keywords": "adults,all ages",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you teach beginners?",
      "a": "Yes, we welcome beginners at any age. Tell us whether you have any experience so we can place you in the right class.",
      "keywords": "beginner,new",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do wedding dance lessons?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer wedding dance packages of five lessons. Tell us your wedding date so we can plan the lessons before it.",
      "keywords": "wedding dance",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you prepare for AMEB exams?",
      "a": "Yes, we prepare students for AMEB and other exams. Exam prep is charged per lesson, and we confirm the exam level when you enrol.",
      "keywords": "ameb,exam",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer online lessons?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer online lessons by video call. Tell us the instrument or style, and we will confirm the online set-up.",
      "keywords": "online,remote",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "How long is a lesson?",
      "a": "Lessons are usually 30, 45, or 60 minutes, depending on the class or lesson type.",
      "keywords": "how long,time",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do I need an instrument?",
      "a": "For instrument lessons, yes. For piano, we can teach on our studio piano, or advise on a home keyboard.",
      "keywords": "instrument,keyboard,piano",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "What should students wear?",
      "a": "Comfortable clothing, and dance shoes or socks for dance classes. Uniforms or costumes are available for some styles.",
      "keywords": "wear,clothing,shoes",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you run concerts?",
      "a": "Yes, we run an annual concert and showcases. Ask us about the showcase fee before you enrol.",
      "keywords": "concert,showcase",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer a free trial?",
      "a": "{trial_note} Ask us how to book a trial lesson before you commit to a term.",
      "keywords": "trial,free",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your cancellation policy?",
      "a": "Cancelling with less than {cancellation_notice} may incur a fee. Tell us early if your student needs to miss a lesson.",
      "keywords": "cancel,cancellation",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you have sibling discounts?",
      "a": "{discount_note} Tell us about all the students in the family when you enquire.",
      "keywords": "sibling,discount",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "Where are you located?",
      "a": "We are located in the local metro area. Ask us for the studio address and directions when you book.",
      "keywords": "location,where",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer make-up lessons?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer a make-up lesson when a booked lesson is missed. Let us know as early as possible so we can plan the make-up time.",
      "keywords": "make up,missed,rebook",
      "priority": 8
    }
  ],
